---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import { site } from '../data/site';
---
<Base
  title="Privacy Policy"
  description="How Pearl River Marketing collects and uses information submitted through this website."
  noindex
>
  <section class="section">
    <div class="container prose">
      <p class="notice"><strong>Draft for review.</strong> This policy has not been reviewed by an attorney. Have it reviewed and fill in the bracketed items before relying on it.</p>
      <h1>Privacy Policy</h1>
      <p class="muted">Last updated: [date to be set when finalized]</p>

      <p>This policy explains what information {site.name} ("we", "us") collects through this website, how we use it, and how to contact us about it.</p>

      <h2>Information you give us</h2>
      <p>When you submit the consultation form, we collect the details you enter:</p>
      <ul>
        <li>Your name, email address and business name</li>
        <li>Your website or social media page and your phone number, if you choose to provide them</li>
        <li>The services you are interested in</li>
        <li>Your message</li>
        <li>Your agreement to this policy (the consent checkbox)</li>
      </ul>
      <p>The form also records the time it was opened and a random identifier for each form view. These are used only to block automated spam and prevent duplicate submissions, and are not linked to any tracking.</p>
      <p>If you call, text or email us, we receive the information you share in that conversation.</p>

      <h2>How we use it</h2>
      <p>We use this information to respond to your inquiry, schedule a consultation, prepare a recommendation or quote, and keep a record of our conversation. We do not sell your information, and we do not add you to a marketing email list.</p>

      <h2>Service providers</h2>
      <p>We use a small number of providers to run this website and deliver form submissions:</p>
      <ul>
        <li><strong>Website hosting</strong> (Vercel). Like most hosts, it processes technical data such as IP address and browser type to serve and secure the site.</li>
        <li><strong>Email delivery</strong> (Resend). Form submissions are sent to our business inbox through this service. The form contents are not stored in a database on this website.</li>
      </ul>
      <p>These providers process information on our behalf to provide their services.</p>

      <h2>Cookies and analytics</h2>
      <p>This website does not currently use analytics, advertising pixels or tracking cookies. Fonts are served from this website, not from a third party. If we add analytics or advertising tools in the future, we will update this policy first and ask for consent where required.</p>

      <h2>How long we keep it</h2>
      <p>We keep inquiry details for as long as needed to respond and, if you become a client, for the length of our working relationship and any period required for business records. [Retention period to be confirmed.]</p>

      <h2>Your choices</h2>
      <p>You can ask us what information we hold about you, ask us to correct it, or ask us to delete it, subject to any records we are required to keep.</p>

      <h2>Children</h2>
      <p>This website is intended for businesses and is not directed to children under 13. We do not knowingly collect information from children.</p>

      <h2>Contact</h2>
      <p>For privacy questions or requests, contact {site.name} in {site.city}, {site.regionName}, at <a href={`tel:${site.phone.e164}`}>{site.phone.display}</a>{site.email ? <>, or email <a href={`mailto:${site.email}`}>{site.email}</a></> : ' [business email to be added]'}.</p>
    </div>
  </section>
</Base>

<style>
  .prose h1 { margin-block: 1.5rem .5rem; font-size: var(--step-3); }
  .notice { margin-bottom: 1rem; }
</style>
